# GPT ↔ Cursor handoff is mandatory

This project has a shared, repository-backed context system at
`docs/ai-handoff/`. Cursor's private chat is never sufficient task context.

Before working, read `docs/ai-handoff/STATE.md` and the latest entries in
`docs/ai-handoff/CONVERSATION.md`. On meaningful user requests, decisions,
implementation progress, validation, or before a response, write a concise
log/checkpoint. Use `node scripts/ai-handoff.mjs` where possible.

At a handoff, make the state independently actionable: changed files, exact
validation result, unresolved risk, and one next action. Never write secrets
to either context file.

The complete cross-agent procedure is in `AGENTS.md` and
`docs/ai-handoff/README.md`.
